# Membership summary

Members may terminate their membership in writing. The notice period for members is forty-five (45) days, counted from the day the written notice is received [[cite:obs-d59d0d4f07c80c3f5dfb62875978714531d642fa "Members may terminate their membership in writing. The notice period for members is forty-five (45) days, counted from the day the written notice is received."]].

The expense approval threshold is 500 EUR per single expense [[cite:obs-8f9d49cd89ae77bf7b7897183fe63794e959a45f "With effect from 1 October 2026 the expense approval threshold is 500 EUR per single expense."]].
